  "description": "The Weekender Nomad is built on our comfortable and sturdy Chromoly steel Weekender frame platform. On longer rides, you'll appreciate the multiple hand positions of the flared FSA Adventure handlebars. The SRAM Apex drivetrain can take you over mountains thanks to the massive range of 11 smooth-shifting gears, all reachable through the click of one finger.\n\nHigh-volume tires will carry you over whatever your adventure challenges you with, and the durable build-quality won't bat an eye at being loaded up with racks and bags. The Nomad is enjoyable on laid-back rides, hard-charging segments, and long-distance tours\n\nThe Nomad features the Weekender’s geometry that is built around 27.5 x 2.0” Continental tires, and also leaves plenty of space for compatibility with 700c wheels if you ever feel like changing it up.*\n\nMatte Classic White available in Small, Medium, Large, and X-Large.\n\n*Please note that the X-Small and Small Weekenders use 27.5 x 1.65\" Maxxis tires and these frame sizes are not compatible with 700c wheels.",
